# Holding site design

Letterhead, not a product landing: few words, generous air, no chrome.

## Tokens

Live in `src/input.css` (`@theme`). After token or utility-class changes, run `npm run build:css` and commit `assets/site.css`.

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `paper` | `#F4F1EA` | Page background |
| `ink` | `#1A1916` | Text; filled controls |
| `muted` | `#4F4B45` | Secondary text |
| `rule` | `#D4CFC4` | Hairline borders |
| `clay` | `#D2644A` | Focus / accent only |

Do not invent colours or a second palette. Do not use clay as a large CTA fill.

## Mark and header

Live header is tight mark `img` + CSS `.wordmark`. Do not put lockup SVGs in the header. Do not rewrite SVG viewBoxes. Do not use `-ml` or clip/translate to align the mark.

| File | Use |
|---|---|
| `assets/logo/GoodStanding-mark-tight.svg` | Header + favicon source |
| `assets/logo/GoodStanding-mark-padded.svg` | Archive / letterhead only; keep its viewBox |
| `assets/logo/GoodStanding-lockup-horizontal.svg` | Archive / letterhead / email only |
| `assets/logo/GoodStanding-lockup-stacked.svg` | Archive / letterhead / email only |

- `.brand`: `inline-flex items-center gap-1`
- `.brand-mark`: `h-[34px] w-[34px]`; HTML 34×34; `object-contain`
- `.wordmark`: `text-[1.625rem]`, tracking `0.02em`, weight normal
- Wordmark stack: `"Iowan Old Style"`, `"Palatino Linotype"`, Palatino, Georgia, `"Times New Roman"`, serif
- Body: system sans. Do not load webfonts
- Header `py-6`. Shared inset: `px-6 sm:px-10`. Footer `pt-8 pb-7`
- Do not enlarge body, tagline, footer, or Privacy nav to match the wordmark
- Brand is not underlined (`a:not(.brand)`). Focus-visible: 2px clay outline, 2px offset

## Pages

Never `[&_p]:m-0`. Use `gap-y-*` or winning margins. Do not put `flex flex-col` around `main p` without `gap-y-*`.

- Homepage main: tagline + one why paragraph, `max-w-[34rem]`, body `mt-8`. One text survey link (`https://research.goodstanding.co.uk/r/Bz5oLN?ref=homepage`); not a button. No `email=`. No mailto in main. Block wrapper so `main p` margins collapse
- `/thanks/`: `h1` + a few short paragraphs. Same chrome. No mid-page Privacy · Contact · Home row. No product pitch
- Privacy: long-form. Air after `h1` before “Last updated”. `mt-10` before each `h2`. Do not rewrite legal copy to fix spacing

## Footer

Legal block first (substance unchanged): Good Standing Software Ltd, Companies House number, registered office. Then labels only — Contact · Survey · Privacy.

| Label | Target |
|---|---|
| Contact | `mailto:info@goodstanding.co.uk` (same tab) |
| Survey | `https://research.goodstanding.co.uk/r/Bz5oLN?ref=footer` (`target="_blank"` `rel="noopener noreferrer"`) |
| Privacy | `privacy/` or `./` on that page (same tab) |

Form is Bz5oLN on `research.goodstanding.co.uk`. Tally redirect to `/thanks/` is wired in Tally, not this repo.

## Chrome and static

- No cards, gradients, or animation
- Links underlined (ink ~55%; full ink on hover). Brand and nav not underlined at rest
- GitHub Pages: committed HTML + `assets/site.css`. No runtime
- Umami Cloud script in each public `<head>` only (page views; no cookies). No other trackers or pixels
- Keep the existing `assets/site.css` preload. Do not add more
- Do not invent schema.org types or a second JSON-LD graph
